}}{{TournamentPageStart|twitchid= |toclimit=2|text=The '''4 Nations 2026 Halloween Heist''' is an off-season tournament after the 2026 season of United Kingdom's amateur league, operated by [[UKEL]]. }}

==Overview==
=== Format ===
* Group Stage 1:
** 12 teams participate
*** 6 from Division 2
*** 6 from open qualifiers
** 4 groups
** Double [[Round Robin]]
** All matches are best of one
** Winner of each group advances
* Group Stage 2:
** 14 teams participate
*** 10 from Division 1
*** 4 from Group Stage 1
** 4 groups
** Double [[Round Robin]]
** All matches are best of one
** Top 2 of each group advance
* Playoffs:
** Double elimination
** Group winners start in the winner's bracket
** Finals are best of five
** All other matches are best of three

