}}{{TournamentPageStart|twitchid=|toclimit=2|text=The '''EMEA Masters 2026 Summer''' is the twentieth edition of Europe's premier semi-professional tournament englobing 13 ''League of Legends'' '''European Regional Leagues''' (ERL). Previously known as '''EU Masters''', this is the tenth edition of the tournament after uniting EU, TR, CIS, and MENA as the EMEA region. Each ERL send their best regional participants to represent their country and fight for regional pride. The ''EMEA Masters'' serve as the secondary layer of competitions underneath the [[LoL European Championship|LEC]].}}
==Overview==
=== Format ===
* '''Swiss Stage''' 
** 32 teams participate
*** 24 teams prequalified + the 8 qualifiers of the [[EMEA Masters/2026 Season/Summer LCQ|LCQ]]
** Swiss-style format with seven rounds
** Qualification and Elimination matches are best of three, all other matches are best of one
** Top 13 teams advance to Playoffs
** The teams finishing in 14th to 16th place advance to the Knockout Matches
* '''Knockout Matches'''
** 6 teams participate
*** 3 EMEA teams from [[2026 World Star Challengers Invitational|WSCI 2026]]
*** 3 teams ranked 14th to 16th from Swiss Stage
** All matches are best of five
** 3 teams advance to Playoffs
* '''Playoffs'''
** 16 teams participate
*** 13 teams from Swiss Stage
*** 3 teams from Knockout Matches
** Single elimination bracket
** All matches are best of five

