==Overview==
=== Format ===
''Regional Merit will only apply to the Regions with the highest number of Guest Teams in LCP 2026. Since there are two such Regions in 2026, [[VCS]] and [[PCS]] (2 teams each), there will be two Regional Merit Matches.''
;PCS Regional Merit Match
*2 Teams
**The lowest-ranked '''LCP Guest Team''' from [[PCS]] based on [[LCP/2026 Season/Championship Points|Championship Points]]
**The champion of the [[PCS/2026 Season/Summer Season|PCS Summer]]
*All matches are Best of Five
*''If both '''LCP Guest Teams''' from [[PCS]] qualify for the [[2026 Season World Championship|Worlds 2026]], or if one qualifies for the [[2026 Season World Championship|Worlds 2026]] and the other qualifies for the FFA, this match will be canceled and the champion of the [[PCS/2026 Season/Summer Season|PCS Summer]] will qualify for the FFA.
*Winner qualifies for the [[LCP/2027 Season|LCP 2027 Season]]
;<del>VCS Regional Merit Match</del>
*<del>2 Teams</del>
**<del>The lowest-ranked '''LCP Guest Team''' from [[VCS]] based on [[LCP/2026 Season/Championship Points|Championship Points]]</del>
**<del>The champion of the [[VCS/2026 Season/Finals Stage 2|VCS Finals]]</del>
*<del>All matches are Best of Five</del>
*<del>''If both '''LCP Guest Teams''' from [[VCS]] qualify for the [[2026 Season World Championship|Worlds 2026]], or if one qualifies for the [[2026 Season World Championship|Worlds 2026]] and the other qualifies for the FFA, this match will be canceled and the champion of the [[VCS/2026 Season/Finals Stage 2|VCS Finals]] will qualify for the FFA.</del>
*<del>Winner qualifies for the [[LCP/2027 Season|LCP 2027 Season]]</del>
*As both '''LCP Guest Teams''' from [[VCS]] qualify for the [[2026 Season World Championship|Worlds 2026]], this match is canceled and the champion of the [[VCS/2026 Season/Finals Stage 2|VCS Finals]] will qualify for the FFA.
;Free for All Bracket
*5 Teams
**The champion of the [[LCP Wildcard/2026 Season/Playoffs|LCP Wildcard]]
**The champion of the [[VCS/2026 Season/Finals Stage 2|VCS Finals]]
**The champion of the [[LJL/2026 Season/Summer Championship|LJL Summer Championship]]
**The champion of the [[FLASH Oceania/2026 Season/Playoffs|FLASH Oceania]]
**The lowest-ranked '''LCP Guest Team''' based on [[LCP/2026 Season/Championship Points|Championship Points]]
*The '''LCP Guest Team''' receives a bye to the '''Finals'''
*Single-elimination bracket
*All matches are Best of Five
*Winner qualifies for the [[LCP/2027 Season|LCP 2027 Season]]

