==Overview==
=== Format ===
==== Regional Merit Match ====
* Two teams participate
** The lowest-ranked guest team among the region with the most guest teams in the [[LCP/2025 Season/Season Finals|LCP 2025 Season Finals]]
*** In case all guest teams from that region qualify for [[Worlds 2025]], the second-lowest ranked guest team will participate in the Regional Merit Match.
*** In case that region has one team relegated for the Free For All, the second-lowest ranked guest team will participate in the Regional Merit Match.
*** In case all three guest teams (excluding the team participating in the Free For All) qualify for [[Worlds 2025]], this round will not take place. And FFA will change the format to fit 6 teams.
** The regional champion from the same region as the relegated team under the Regional Merit system
* Match is best of five
* Winner qualifies for the [[LCP/2026 Season|LCP 2026 Season]]

==== Free for All Bracket ====
* Five teams participate
** The champions of the three regions that are not participating in the Regional Merit match
** The lowest-ranked guest team from the [[LCP/2025 Season/Season Finals|LCP 2025 Season Finals]]
** The champion of the [[LCP Wildcard/2025 Season/Playoffs|LCP Wildcard 2025 Playoffs]]
* The '''LCP''' guest team will get a bye to the '''Finals'''
* Single elimination bracket
* All matches are best of five
* Winner qualifies for the [[LCP/2026 Season|LCP 2026 Season]]

