==Overview==
=== Format ===
* 32 teams participate
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 1|Qualifier 1]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 2|Qualifier 2]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 3|Qualifier 3]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 4|Qualifier 4]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 5|Qualifier 5]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 6|Qualifier 6]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 7|Qualifier 7]]
** Top 4 teams fom the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Qualifiers/Qualifier 8|Qualifier 8]]
* Teams are randomly drawn into four groups of eight teams each
* Single Round Robin
* Matches are best of two (Bo2)
** Team that wins a match 2–0 earns 3 points
** Teams that tie a match 1-1 earn 1 point each
** Team that loses a match 0-2 earns no points
* Top 4 teams from each group qualify for the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 3 Playoffs|Playoffs]]

