==Overview==
=== Format ===
* 16 teams from the [[Legends Academy/2026/Season 0 Group Stage|Group Stage]] participate
* Single Elimination Bracket, with a 3rd Place Match
* Finals are best of five, all other matches are best of three
* Playoffs features a draft system, called "Fearless Draft": teams may only pick any champion once in a series
** Example: If {{ci|Aatrox}} is picked by Team A in Game 1, Team A AND Team B can't pick him again for the rest of the series

