==Overview==
=== Format ===
* 24 teams are split in two groups, A and B
* Single Round Robin within each group
* All matches are best of three.
* Top four teams from each group advance to [[LigaGG/CELOL Série B/2026 Season/Split 2 Playoffs|Playoffs]]
* Bottom three teams from each group are [[LigaGG/Torneio do Grompe/2027 Season/Split 1|demoted]]
* Ties are broken by the following methods:
*# The team with less losses by W.O
*# Head-to-head record during regular season
*# If still tied, a tiebreaker game will be played

